    "tooltip.chemical_industry.shift": "§7Hold [§fShift§7] for details",
    "block.chemical_industry.fluidized_bed.detail": "§7Attach to the side of a §fCreate Fluid Tank§7.\n§7Supply water to the back tank, heat below, ventilation above.\n§7Insert catalyst and ore powder for calcination.\n§7Fluid output is collected by an adjacent tank (condenser).\n§7§oSupports multiple recipes (to be expanded in future updates).",
    "block.chemical_industry.electrolyzer.detail": "§7Three-part multiblock: §cCathode §7│ §8Center §7│ §9Anode\n§7Must be aligned horizontally, facing the same direction.\n§7§cCathode§7：Bottom in (water) · Left out (liquid) · Top out (gas)\n§7§9Anode§7：Bottom in (feed) · Right out (liquid) · Top out (gas)\n§7§eBoth electrodes§7 must be connected to §fWire Connectors§7.\n§7Place catalyst in the Center to start.\n§7§oSupports multiple recipes (to be expanded in future updates).",
    "block.chemical_industry.sulfur_ore.detail": "§7Drops §eSulfur Powder§7.\n§7Generates underground in the Overworld.\n§7Calcinate in Fluidized Bed → §eSulfuric Acid",
    "block.chemical_industry.pyrite_ore.detail": "§7Drops §6Raw Pyrite§7.\n§7Generates underground in the Overworld.\n§7Calcination yields §eSulfuric Acid §7+ §cIron Oxide",
    "block.chemical_industry.rock_salt_ore.detail": "§7Drops §fSodium Chloride§7.\n§7Generates underground in the Overworld.\n§7Electrolysis yields §aCl₂§7, §bH₂§7, §6NaOH",
    "block.chemical_industry.niter_ore.detail": "§7Drops §fPotassium Nitrate§7.\n§7Generates underground in the Overworld.\n§7Fertilizer & gunpowder precursor (future update)",
    "item.chemical_industry.sulfur_powder.detail": "§7Dropped from Sulfur Ore.\n§7Calcinate in Fluidized Bed → §eSulfuric Acid",
    "item.chemical_industry.raw_pyrite.detail": "§7Dropped from Pyrite Ore.\n§7Calcinate in Fluidized Bed → §eSulfuric Acid §7+ §cIron Oxide",
    "item.chemical_industry.sodium_chloride.detail": "§7Dropped from Rock Salt Ore. Table salt.\n§7Right-click water source → §bNaCl Solution",
    "item.chemical_industry.potassium_nitrate.detail": "§7Dropped from Niter Ore.\n§7(Can be used for nitric acid & fertilizer in future updates)",
    "item.chemical_industry.iron_oxide.detail": "§7Byproduct of pyrite calcination.\n§7Important industrial material.",
    "item.chemical_industry.sodium_hydroxide.detail": "§7Strong base, product of NaCl electrolysis.\n§7Right-click water source → §6NaOH Solution",
    "item.chemical_industry.fluidized_bed_controller": "Fluidized Bed Controller",
    "item.chemical_industry.fluidized_bed_controller_2": "Fluidized Bed Controller II",
    "tooltip.chemical_industry.gas_canister.detail": "§7Stores and transports gases.\n§7Right-click §fCreate Fluid Tank§7: fill empty / drain filled.\n§7Right-click block: release gas (colored particles).\n§7Max capacity: §e1000mB",
    "block.chemical_industry.air_compressor.detail": "§7Gear-driven air compressor.\n§7Connect a §fShaft§7 to the back face.\n§7Pumps out §bCompressed Air§7 from the back.\n§7Capacity: §e8000mB",
